<Layout title="MBot Terms of Service | manpuc" lang="en">
    <div class="container main-content">
        <div class="back-nav animate-fade-up">
            <a href="/en/works/mbot/" class="back-link">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline></svg>
                Back to MBot
            </a>
        </div>

        <header>
            <h1>MBot Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Terms of Service</p>
        </header>

        <div class="neumorph-card animate-fade-up">
            <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> June 17, 2026</p>
                <p>
                    These Terms of Service (hereinafter referred to as the "Terms") define the conditions of use for "MBot" (hereinafter referred to as the "Bot"). By adding the Bot to your Discord server or utilizing it, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h2>1. Disclaimer</h2>
                <p>
                    The developer holds no responsibility for any damages (such as data loss, server impact, etc.) caused by the use of this Bot. Use the Bot at your own risk.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h2>2. Prohibited Actions</h2>
                <p>
                    The following actions are prohibited when using the Bot:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Intentionally placing excessive load on the Bot (e.g., spamming).</li>
                    <li>Actions that violate laws, public order, or Discord's Terms of Service.</li>
                    <li>Intentionally exploiting bugs or vulnerabilities in the Bot.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    If any prohibited actions are detected, access to the Bot may be restricted or terminated.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h2>3. Changes and Termination of Service</h2>
                <p>
                    The developer reserves the right to modify, add, or temporarily/permanently suspend the functions and services provided by the Bot without prior notice.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>4. Changes to the Terms</h2>
                <p>
                    The developer may change these Terms without prior notice if deemed necessary. The modified Terms will become effective once posted on this page.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
